{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misocircularprogressindicator"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCircularProgressIndicator"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOCircularProgressIndicator"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Variants","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Variants"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value in ","type":"text"},{"code":"[0, 1]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Values outside this range are coerced.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": no ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}]}]}]},{"text":"Statuses","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Statuses"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Track","anchor":"Track"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Animation (determinate mode only)"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" to the target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are always disabled when "},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" flag.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Helper text","level":2,"anchor":"Helper-text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the circular indicator to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The helper text is always centered under the indicator.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","type":"reference"},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description. The percentage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value and its ","type":"text"},{"code":"%","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"75%\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with helper text","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with percentage and description","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  helperText: .percent(\"of 100 MB\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                  helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator()","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with helper text","    MISOCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info, helperText: \"Processing...\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.name"},{"type":"text","text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads: "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Example: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and is marked with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"type":"text","text":" trait so that assistive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"technologies know the value is changing.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait is used."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Version","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOCircularProgressIndicator"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOCircularProgressIndicator"}],"title":"MISOCircularProgressIndicator","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents29MISOCircularProgressIndicatorV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:size:helperText:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:acce